sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Svc as Service
    participant GW as Write gateway
    participant In as Ingester
    participant WAL as Write-ahead log
    participant Blk as Block store
    participant Cmp as Compactor
    participant Q as Querier
    Svc->>GW: samples with labels
    GW->>In: route by series hash
    In->>WAL: append durably
    In->>In: Gorilla-compress into the head block
    Note over In: ~1.3 bytes per sample after compression
    In->>Blk: flush sealed block
    Cmp->>Blk: merge and downsample older blocks
    Q->>In: query recent window
    Q->>Blk: query historical window
    Blk-->>Q: merged series
    Q-->>Svc: result
